# DUSKLING M2, FERN STEPS (room 2): a stair of fern steps over a pit, and a prickle at the foot.
# Played from its way in with plain button presses (LEFT is the D-pad
# side, A the button side), found once by the route finder (cheat solve).
game duskling
wait 5
cheat room 2
hold A 2
wait 2
hold A 10
hold LEFT+A 16
wait 6
hold A 2
wait 2
hold A 25
hold LEFT+A 16
wait 4
hold A 2
wait 2
hold A 25
hold LEFT+A 16
wait 14
hold A 2
wait 2
hold A 26
wait 2
hold A 30
hold LEFT+A 16
wait 6
hold A 2
wait 2
hold A 60
wait 2
expect room == 3

# jumping straight up from the top step finds the warp over the blue bells.
cheat room 2
hold A 2
wait 2
hold A 10
hold LEFT+A 16
wait 6
hold A 2
wait 2
hold A 25
hold LEFT+A 16
wait 4
hold A 2
wait 2
hold A 25
hold LEFT+A 16
hold A 24
hold LEFT 5
hold LEFT+A 1
hold A 13
wait 2
expect room == 37
